  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OCCEFS Strengthening of Institutional Accountability Systems through Supreme Audit Institutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OCCEFS STRENGTHENING OF INSTITUTIONAL ACCOUNTABILITY SYSTEMS THROUGH SUPREME AUDIT INSTITUTIONS (i) to build capacity of OCCEFS and its member institutions to develop and monitor public financial accountability information standards and indicators, and develop tools for citizenry oversight of public financial information; and (ii) to build capacity of OCCEFS member institutions to respond to their own accountability, by professionally carrying out their core function of auditing public financial information</narrative>
  </description>
